# docs/virtualization-plan.md §6.3: the ONE scene exercising a real
# narrowed band on all five lanes, because its guest is compiled where
# ledger/varied are Python and stop at the desktops. Every number here
# is DATA — the band's width belongs to the core's tests and the
# table-tier probe.
expect_columns column#0 "Name|Size"
expect_column_edges column#0 2
# The whole collection is data behind a band of widgets.
expect_window column#0 0 400
# Deep by identity: a row no tier should have realized yet.
scroll_to_row column#0 r200
expect_window column#0 200 400
# Back: membership is arithmetic, not history — byte-identical to the
# opening line on every platform.
scroll_to_row column#0 r000
expect_window column#0 0 400
